6165737 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186165734 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186165738 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186165734 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186165739 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186165734 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186165734 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186165734 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "47e4c0ba-9e7f-5fb9-9608-805ed6d49159" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186165735 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{2}(\\cosh 4 - 2)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186165735 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186165735 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "bd6e9774-c708-5162-bb4d-19b451f03255" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186165736 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{8}\\sinh 4 + 1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186165736 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186165736 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "0f7aeca1-ae58-59c4-9763-4fc3f5642bf8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186165737 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{2}(\\sinh 4 + 3)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186165737 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186165737 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "2e435a86-0a0f-5ef2-b09f-d61568f35db3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186165738 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{3}\\sinh 4 - 1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186165738 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186165738 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "50f4aa57-a8c8-5648-b00e-f119bdbc5ca8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186165739 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{2}(\\cosh 4 + 6)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186165739 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186165739 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "5574d8a8-5cd6-54b0-9707-755a1a62e037" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166640 #edb/ref 1069 "e-8440" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166640 #edb/ref 1071 "Calculate\n$\\displaystyle \\int 4\\sinh 2x \\cosh 2x \\, \\textrm{d}x$." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166640 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "41c8053f-0ad2-5b59-ba77-8f4fda1db022" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166640 #edb/ref 1074 "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the double-angle formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\sin {2\\theta}=2\\sin \\theta \\cos \\theta\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the double-angle formula for the hyperbolic sine:\n\n$$\n\\sinh {2\\theta} =2\\sinh \\theta \\cosh \\theta\n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta= 2x$, we get\n\n$$\n\\sinh {4x} =2\\sinh 2x \\cosh 2x\n$$\n\nRearranging the above formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{1}{2}\\sinh {4x}= \\sinh 2x \\cosh 2x\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\int4\\sinh 2x\\cosh 2xdx &= \\int4 \\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\sinh 4xdx \\\\\n&= \\int2\\sinh 4xdx \\\\\n&= 2\\int\\sinh 4xdx \\\\\n&= 2 \\cdot \\frac{1}{4}\\cosh 4x + C \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{2}\\cosh 4x + C\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166641 #edb/ref 1069 "e-8441" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166641 #edb/ref 1071 "Calculate $\\displaystyle \\int \\cosh^2{x} + \\sinh^2{x}\\ \\, \\textrm{d}x$." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166641 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "b6c11fbd-00db-5506-baf0-2b6a94bfa6e8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166641 #edb/ref 1074 "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the following double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cos{2x}= \\cos^2{x}-\\sin^2{x}\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the following double-angle formula for the hyperbolic cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cosh 2x = \\cosh^2{x} + \\sinh^2{x}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\int\\cosh^{2} x + \\sinh^{2} xdx &= \\int\\cosh 2xdx \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{2}\\sinh 2x + C\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166642 #edb/ref 1069 "e-8442" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166642 #edb/ref 1071 "Calculate $\\displaystyle \\int 2\\cosh^2 x \\, \\textrm{d}x$." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166642 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "c91d7451-c9b5-57a1-9284-ec3fb617220c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166642 #edb/ref 1074 "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the following double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cos{2x} =2\\cos^2 x -1\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the following double-angle formula for the hyperbolic cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cosh{2x} =2\\cosh^2 x -1\n$$\n\nRearranging, we have\n\n$$\n\\cosh^2 x = \\dfrac{1}{2} \\left(\\cosh 2x +1 \\right)\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\int2\\cosh^{2} xdx &= \\int2 \\cdot \\frac{1}{2}(\\cosh 2x + 1)dx \\\\\n&= \\int(\\cosh 2x + 1)dx \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{2}\\sinh 2x + x + C\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166643 #edb/ref 1069 "e-8443" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166643 #edb/ref 1071 "Evaluate $\\displaystyle \\int_{0}^{\\ln 2} 8\\sinh^2{x} \\, \\textrm{d}x$." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166643 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "5d3a47d6-5a07-5fb6-9f57-23e74a7ba24f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166643 #edb/ref 1074 "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the following double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cos {2x}=1-2\\sin^2x\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the following double-angle formula for the hyperbolic cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cosh{2x} = 1+ 2\\sinh^2{x}\n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above formula as\n\n$$\n\\sinh^2x = \\dfrac{1}{2}\\left(\\cosh {2x} -1\\right)\n$$\n\nWe can now integrate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\int_{0}^{\\ln 2}8\\sinh^{2} xdx &= \\int_{0}^{\\ln 2}8 \\cdot \\frac{1}{2}(\\cosh 2x - 1)dx \\\\\n&= \\int_{0}^{\\ln 2}4\\cosh 2x - 4dx \\\\\n&= \\left.(2\\sinh 2x - 4x)\\right|_{0}^{\\ln 2} \\\\\n&= (2\\sinh (2\\ln 2) - 4\\ln 2) - (2\\sinh 0 - 4 \\cdot 0) \\\\\n&= 2 \\cdot \\frac{e^{2\\ln 2} - e^{-2\\ln 2}}{2} - 4\\ln 2 \\\\\n&= (2^{2} - 2^{-2}) - 4\\ln 2 \\\\\n&= \\frac{15}{4} - 4\\ln 2\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166802 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186048878 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166802 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186049303 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186166802 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186167416 #edb/ref 17592186